commit baf9568b9df83565ac25e8593bf8e93aeefd6293
Author: root <root@LAPTOP-FVNNQNU9.localdomain>
Date:   Wed Sep 9 18:24:43 2026 +0800

    cpu: rv64: hoist softmax f16 dispatch/constants and drop reduce-max gate
    
    Resolve the f16 gather/scatter kernels once outside the per-element loop,
    remove the reduce-max length gate (the kernel has a runtime-VL tail), and
    materialize the 5 exp polynomial coefficients once before the loop instead
    of every iteration.

